'''Ent''' is an {{Rarity|e|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water on [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Spawning ==
'''Ent''' can be fished up from water on [[Moonglade Marsh]]. It requires {{skl|fishing|level XII (12)}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Ent''' is {{Green|500}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|5%|1|20|sea creatures}} with all [[Sea Creatures]] unlocked. Currently, there are no modifiers that can be used to increase its weight.

